==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|frjósa|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{recons|freusaną|lang=gem-pro}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|is}} {{recons|prews-|lang=ine-pro}}, {{recons|prus-|lang=ine-pro}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈfrjouːsa/|lang=is}}
* {{rhymes|ouːsa|lang=is}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-strong|fraus|frusu|frosið}}

# {{intransitive}} to [[freeze]]

====Conjugation====
